abstract: >-
  Exact small values, certified witnesses, and self-contained verification suites for several
  problems from erdosproblems.com aligned with google-deepmind/formal-conjectures: #600 (e(n,2)
  for n = 3..14 via CP-SAT), #642 (f(n) for n = 0..9 via canonical graph enumeration and
  branch-and-bound, with general 3n - 7 lower bound), #934 (t = 2 closed form), #983
  (f(pi(n)+1, n) for n = 2..46 via Z3 CEGAR under both |S| <= r and |S| == r), and a standalone
  Lean 4 audit of even-cycle-free extremal edge counts (floor(3(n-1)/2) = OEIS A032766,
  diverging from A380408 at index 24 and disambiguated from Erdős #151). Computations were
  assisted by AI agents; all values are checked by independent verifiers.
